Package: palbociclibsimulation
Title: Palbociclib Therapeutic Drug Monitoring — Population PK/PD Simulation & Pharmacoeconomic Analysis
Version: 2.0.0
Date: 2026-05-19
Authors@R: 
    person("Mohammad Bisam Ali", "Aslam", 
